  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个 Serilum 模组。充满爱心打造。为 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>Grindstone Sharper Tools 是一款极简模组，它赋予了磨石一种能力：可以临时提升在其上打磨过的工具的伤害。<br><br></p>\n<p>在磨石上<strong>潜行+右键点击</strong>任意工具即可为其开刃。这将使工具获得<strong>N</strong>&nbsp;次开刃使用次数（具体数值由配置文件定义）。</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"包含于 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"包含于 Serilum 的 RPG 组合包中\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"环境：服务器端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的配置选项：</p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><span><strong>usesAfterGrinding</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 32，最小值 1，最大值 5000<br>&nbsp;工具在磨石上使用后获得的锋利使用次数。<br><br><span><strong>sharpenedDamageModifier</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 1.5，最小值 0，最大值 100.0<br>&nbsp;开刃工具的伤害修正系数。<br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>sendUsesLeftInChat</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true<br>&nbsp;当开刃次数剩余 75%、50%、25%、10% 时，向使用者发送聊天消息。<br><br><span><strong>showUsesLeftInItemName</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true<br>&nbsp;在物品名称中显示剩余使用次数。<br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>nameUsesPrefix</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 \"(Sharpened uses: \"<br>&nbsp;工具名称中剩余开刃使用次数的前缀。<br><br><span><strong>nameUsesSuffix</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 =&nbsp; \")\"<br>&nbsp;工具名称中剩余开刃使用次数的后缀。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><strong>手持工具，对磨石进行潜行+右键点击：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/grindstone-sharper-tools/a.jpg\" alt=\"0\" width=\"1423\" height=\"827\"></strong><br><br><strong>这将为工具开刃，并按配置将其信息添加到物品名称中。<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/grindstone-sharper-tools/b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"684\" height=\"281\"></strong><br><br><strong>攻击任何实体时，将根据配置中的修正系数增加伤害：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/grindstone-sharper-tools/c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"664\"></strong><br><br><span><strong>按配置设置，您还可以在聊天栏中接收剩余使用次数的提示：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/grindstone-sharper-tools/d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"137\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"注意事项与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>您可以自由在任何整合包中使用此模组，只要下载源仍托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态内即可。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览及更多信息。</span><br><span><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他反馈，请访问&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
